    "body": "> you can also install bash, right?\r\n\r\nYes, it is possible. however bash is not a static single binary to install, I have to install all bash dependencies to get it work (like glibc, ncurses and readline), right? but if starship supports ash, I guess I just need to compile it to a arm64 static binary and put it to the system.\r\n\r\nBy the way, @romkatv I recently switch to powerlevel10k, great job man!",
