    "updated_at": "2020-03-19T07:24:33Z",
    "body": "> Perhaps it's not difficult for some developers but I guess I need to cross-compile every dependencies into static libs (like *.a not *.so files)\r\n\r\nI know this doesn't address your (perfectly valid) feature request but thought it might be relevant to mention nonetheless. You can install the latest version of Zsh to your home directory as easily as Starship.\r\n\r\n```zsh\r\nsh -c \"$(wget -O- https://raw.githubusercontent.com/romkatv/zsh-bin/master/install)\"\r\n```\r\n\r\nType `~/.zsh-bin/bin/zsh` and you have a decent shell. Add `~/.zsh-bin/bin` to `PATH` for convenience. See https://github.com/romkatv/zsh-bin for details.",
